  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> denote the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>. Then, the value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
